{
  "borough": "Enfield Council",
  "application_type": "All Other",
  "decision": "Refused",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "The proposal provides an unacceptable standard of accommodation with Bedroom 5 measuring only 6.5sqm and a narrow kitchen comprising 13.9sqm, with no additional communal living space resulting in an excessive density of rooms relative to the available floorspace. It fails to provide adequate bedroom and internal communal space for all occupiers, contrary to the minimum standard set out in Policy DMD 5 of Enfield's Development Management Document (2014), Policy D6 of the London Plan (2021) and Chapter 8 of the NPPF (2024).",
    "The proposed development, in the absence of an adequate flood risk assessment, fails to demonstrate how the development will be safe from flooding contrary to Section 14 of the NPPF (2024), Policies SI 12 and SI 13 of the London Plan (2021), CP21 and CP28 of the Enfield Core Strategy (2010), DMD59, DMD60, DMD61 and DMD62 of the Enfield Development Management Document (2014) and the Enfield Strategic Flood Risk Assessment (2021)."
  ],
